Plan for HEExp:
- Unary element-wise op (single input/output, same shape)
- Pattern: clone silu template, replace kernel body with `expf(x)`
- Shape [1,1,128,128] = 16384 elements; HTP scheduler budget is fine
- fp16 overflow risk: with seed=42 N(0,1) inputs no x > 11.09, but kernel uses fp32 promotion + natural fp16 saturation on store
- Op naming: `HEExp` / package `HEExpPackage` / lib `libQnnHtpExp.so`
